%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f988bc0d55107749a911c0375bba164, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dial_Mart_OrbCreator
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerNpcId: mart
  playerFacingPolicy: 0
  lines:
  - speakerName: Mart
    text: Hold on!... Is that one of Toby's orbs?
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: mart
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Mart
    text: I built those. Tiny shell, impossible geometry, ridiculous demand. Best
      problem I've ever had.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: mart
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Mart
    text: Toby's trust doesn't come lightly. He doesn't hand lab Chainlings to just
      anyone.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: mart
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Mart
    text: If you're good enough for him, I can trust the dog too. That's as close
      to a credit check as I need.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: mart
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Mart
    text: "Shop's closing. Not folding \u2014 expanding. Loomspire's a bigger market,
      bigger workshop. One supershop for every tamer who can pay."
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: mart
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Mart
    text: Truck's leaving soon. I left an extra orb in one of the moving crates in
      the store. Help yourself. Consider it user acquisition.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: mart
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Mart
    text: Anything you catch with those orbs, you manage from a Chainling PC. Storage,
      party, the whole roster. Don't leave them rattling around in your pockets.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: mart
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 2
  allowSkip: 1
  skipToEndOfLine: 1
